## UI polish: Invoice card

11 fixes across spacing, typography, contrast, hierarchy, layout, states, motion and tokens. Text and brand hue kept. Tokens from tokens.css.

### Fixes
1. **Spacing**: `padding: 13px` is off the scale. Now `padding: var(--space-12)`. (R-ui-polish-1, R-ui-polish-20)
2. **Spacing**: heading `margin: 0 0 5px` is off the scale. Now `margin: 0 0 var(--space-4)`. (R-ui-polish-1, R-ui-polish-20)
3. **Spacing**: button `padding: 6px 10px` is off the scale. Now `padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-12)`. The second button gets `margin-left: var(--space-8)`, so the two buttons no longer touch. (R-ui-polish-1, R-ui-polish-20)
4. **Typography**: heading `font-size: 22px` is off the scale. Now `var(--font-size-2xl)` with `var(--line-height-heading)` and `var(--font-weight-strong)`. (R-ui-polish-2, R-ui-polish-3, R-ui-polish-8, R-ui-polish-20)
5. **Typography**: paragraph `font-size: 13px` is below the 16 px body minimum. Now `var(--font-size-md)` with `var(--line-height-body)` and `max-width: var(--measure)`. Buttons get `var(--font-size-sm)`, `var(--font-weight-strong)` and `var(--font-family-sans)`, because their default 13.33 px is off the scale. (R-ui-polish-2, R-ui-polish-3, R-ui-polish-8, R-ui-polish-20)
6. **Contrast**: paragraph `#999999` on `#ffffff` is 2.85:1. Now `var(--color-text-muted)`, 6.52:1. (R-ui-polish-4, R-ui-polish-20)
7. **Contrast**: the primary button's white text on `#0d9488` is 3.74:1. Now `var(--color-action-primary-bg)` (#0b7067), the darker step of the same hue, with `var(--color-action-primary-text)`, 5.95:1. (R-ui-polish-4, R-ui-polish-11, R-ui-polish-21)
8. **Hierarchy**: two filled buttons compete. "Pay now" stays the one primary action. "Download PDF" is now secondary: transparent background, `var(--color-action-secondary-text)` text, `var(--color-action-secondary-border)` border. (R-ui-polish-5, R-ui-polish-21)
9. **Layout**: both buttons are below the 44 px target. Now `min-height: var(--size-target-min); min-width: var(--size-target-min)`. (R-ui-polish-7, R-ui-polish-20)
10. **States**: there were no hover, focus or disabled styles. Added `:hover`, `:focus-visible` (`var(--border-width-focus)` outline, 2px offset) and `:disabled` (opacity 0.5, `cursor: not-allowed`) for both buttons. Added `transition` with `var(--duration-base)`, and a `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` block that turns it off. (R-ui-polish-6, R-ui-polish-9, R-ui-polish-20)
11. **Tokens**: raw values replaced by tokens: card background `var(--color-surface-default)`, card border `var(--border-width-hairline) solid var(--color-border-default)`, radius 5px → `var(--radius-md)` (buttons use `var(--radius-control)`), font family → `var(--font-family-sans)`. (R-ui-polish-20)

